{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01U2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$g : S' \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$g' : X' = X_{S'} \\to X$", "MATH_0006": "$x' \\in X'$", "MATH_0007": "$x = g'(x') \\in X$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "$S$", "MATH_0010": "$x$", "MATH_0011": "$(g')^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0012": "$S'$", "MATH_0013": "$x'$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0015": "$S$", "MATH_0016": "$(g')^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0017": "$S'$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-module-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c9bb7a9949555b8b7ad530bd8c6be44ac5ab7c38874cbb3937d19109ccc08882", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1b34f8dbcddfc3b1f29f41140fbb2b75cc0678d593e694cb46e06d065090322b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent sheaf of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of schemes.\nDenote <MATH_0005> the projection.\nLet <MATH_0006> be a point with image <MATH_0007>.\nIf <MATH_0008> is flat over <MATH_0009> at <MATH_0010>, then\n<MATH_0011> is flat over <MATH_0012> at <MATH_0013>.\nIn particular, if <MATH_0014> is flat over <MATH_0015>, then\n<MATH_0016> is flat over <MATH_0017>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c1599967bc28e5f0cc209e6385a43182fc1ea81fddf6c764e53c5ea10de71c37", "unit_id": "tag:01U8:statement"}
